WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.202
Now upload.

2
00:00:01.252 --> 00:00:05.485
Set your project id and API key as environment variables,

3
00:00:05.535 --> 00:00:09.372
then run the same command without the dry-run flag.

4
00:00:09.422 --> 00:00:12.600
It validates the bundle again, stores it,

5
00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:17.592
and prints the build number once the upload is queued for indexing.

